{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアー初日！静岡公演！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46   二期生   宮崎県出身"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まつりちゃんこと松田里奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いていただきありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡公演1日目ありがとうございましたー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "アッツアツでツアー始まりました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobxCdm3h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "無事ツアー初日を迎えることができて良かったです☺️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob7KSGs8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、今日はTHE TIME,をお休みさせていただきました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お休みした分、ライブに全力を尽くしました！！💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日もパワー全開で頑張ります！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobyuAkU2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob2alaxD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesの皆さんも熱中症など、体調には気をつけてくださいね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日は静岡ラスト！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来てくださるみなさん！一緒に夏の思い出作りましょー！✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobJNpALs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "相棒"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいこちゃんたちが写真撮りたいって言ってくれた、嬉しい、、🙈"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobvyQqnD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob611Ebo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobeJg8Sy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "para